<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-LEADING FINISHERS AT MONTEREY INDYCAR.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LEADING FINISHERS AT MONTEREY INDYCAR.</headline>
<dateline>MONTEREY, California 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top ten drivers at</p>
